      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-183569\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">3.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/2798#12751\">Identifying Implicit Quantification</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"183569\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><blockquote>\n<p>There is a real number such that, added to any natural number, gives a positive number.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Express the above in formal language.</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyHard\">H</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sun, Oct 11th @ 7:45 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:15</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
